+- EVIDENCE: the cycle-6 regression, five carried quarantine regressions, two install retained-state tests, one direct `Quarantine` discrimination test, focused `gofmt -l`, `git diff --check`, affected-package build, and affected-package vet all exited 0 as standalone sequential processes. Broad/race/lint/performance/coverage gates were not run per directive; the cancelled broad producer attempt remains non-evidence.
